## When the user says "mobile" or "desktop"

- **"mobile" / "PWA" / "/mobile/"** → only `mobile-ui/`
- **"dashboard" / "desktop" / "Piggy Bank" / "Actions to take"** → only `desktop-ui/` (unless they say mobile too)

If unsure which app they mean, ask once — do not guess by applying the same layout fix to both.
